  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b>A4 용지로 <span style=\"color: #006dd7;\">동서남북을 접어 </span></b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b>퀴즈를 내고 <span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">K볼</span>을 얻는 </b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b>1:1 게임 활동입니다.</b></span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f15d0a1d6a0f805fda481488932fd715cfc3f8ef\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f15d0a1d6a0f805fda481488932fd715cfc3f8ef\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">여기서 <span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>힛! <span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">아이템 K볼</span></b></span>을 도입합니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/61a612ba340856940e1401a71044e24a5894faeb\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/61a612ba340856940e1401a71044e24a5894faeb\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">문제를 맞추면 상대방의 K볼을 가져올 수 있으며</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">K볼은 <span style=\"color: #0593d3;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>번호 1, 2, 3, 4, 5를 모두 모은 학생만</b></span> 보상을 줍니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>자신의</b> <b><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">K볼로 장난을 치지 않게 </span></b></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">본인 이름을 적게</span></b> 하였습니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/816bf3af3edc174bc34894d12e0f74ab681f633b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/816bf3af3edc174bc34894d12e0f74ab681f633b\" data-origin-width=\"491\" data-origin-height=\"682\"></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e742afa1d9eeb153b1a4152e250ce4ae539b7b97?download\" data-file-name=\"종이접기_동서남북.hwp\" data-file-size=\"132608\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHv%26dataid%3D746%26fileid%3D34%26regdt%3D20211208120447&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fe742afa1d9eeb153b1a4152e250ce4ae539b7b97')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">종이접기_동서남북</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">129.50KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7235896fc6ace674880e870acad7560bd1e3fcf3\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7235896fc6ace674880e870acad7560bd1e3fcf3\" data-origin-width=\"482\" data-origin-height=\"676\"></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6f2c61ddc82711266aa9ef30c118d9bde37b5c0f?download\" data-file-name=\"K볼.hwp\" data-file-size=\"668672\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHv%26dataid%3D746%26fileid%3D35%26regdt%3D20211208120447&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F6f2c61ddc82711266aa9ef30c118d9bde37b5c0f')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">K볼</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">653.00KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/708d77cfa6ed14f5395dfdd2dc98c26da11cd1a2\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/708d77cfa6ed14f5395dfdd2dc98c26da11cd1a2\" data-origin-width=\"1472\" data-origin-height=\"915\"></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d2ca477ba234bbfc959e0b199ea9e47f5fa7687c?download\" data-file-name=\"동서납북그림편집.show\" data-file-size=\"184712\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansoftshow\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHv%26dataid%3D746%26fileid%3D36%26regdt%3D20211208120447&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fd2ca477ba234bbfc959e0b199ea9e47f5fa7687c')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">동서납북그림편집</span><span class=\"type\">.show</span></div><div class=\"size\">180.38KB</div></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"color: #ef6f53;\">A4 용지</span>로 동서남북을 접어보겠습니다.</b></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6be08e3478a33404f3acba8605e38a7c79c890a5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6be08e3478a33404f3acba8605e38a7c79c890a5\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e7a6e91cf8b017829fbe6cd386e150a13d64169f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e7a6e91cf8b017829fbe6cd386e150a13d64169f\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"color: #777777;\"><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">학번과 이름</span>을 씁니다.</span></b></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7db646d23765ea9e5c5b90573daa2520796c2d6d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7db646d23765ea9e5c5b90573daa2520796c2d6d\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/70b40c245a99561b5338b0cfe83f618ea9ac564a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/70b40c245a99561b5338b0cfe83f618ea9ac564a\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\">가로, 세로, 대각선, 대각선으로 4방향</span></b>으로 접습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fe65787b2814b120d8b07c4f3093274501a74525\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fe65787b2814b120d8b07c4f3093274501a74525\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"color: #8a3db6;\">꼭지점을</span></b> 모아보겠습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5d1b11115f0a967c1c8bfeadaf9589f3e1807e3d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5d1b11115f0a967c1c8bfeadaf9589f3e1807e3d\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8c7114922c84d63e1ed66cc7c735f41246c87957\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8c7114922c84d63e1ed66cc7c735f41246c87957\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2817bc5c8a6f8ce9956281a6591ccebb9db07c42\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2817bc5c8a6f8ce9956281a6591ccebb9db07c42\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"color: #6164c6;\"><span style=\"color: #8a3db6;\">뒤집어</span> <span style=\"color: #0db4a0;\">다시 꼭지점을</span></span></b> 모아 봅니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/875bccdeee851ffadb15f5ef1614991f1768c2bd\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/875bccdeee851ffadb15f5ef1614991f1768c2bd\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e61c8e1d367675ddbf69d3ae0ad91b88ce95d6a7\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e61c8e1d367675ddbf69d3ae0ad91b88ce95d6a7\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">자! 삼각형이 8개가 나오면<b> </b></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ef6f53;\"><b>각 삼각형마다 문제를 만들어봅니다.</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"color: #0db4a0;\">1개 정도는 프리패스! 통과!</span> </b>칸도 만들어줍니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/52a25683ba49672eabe4c36b546a168fd7609fbc\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/52a25683ba49672eabe4c36b546a168fd7609fbc\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">안쪽에는 <span style=\"color: #1a5490;\"><b>내가 낸 문제의 답</b></span>을 씁니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7fce51a49cf1d922f24c9a6fe2e5a90c2fef9611\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7fce51a49cf1d922f24c9a6fe2e5a90c2fef9611\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/373a3711effc91810306169fb59fa6b5a8ae1ce5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/373a3711effc91810306169fb59fa6b5a8ae1ce5\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/739d4e40cc3a8503d0fbbb0d7a9b9c4309dec911\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/739d4e40cc3a8503d0fbbb0d7a9b9c4309dec911\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\"><b>요렇게 접으면 동서남북 완성!</b></span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a243ef42f644611789c19a3a018f4abd3f9fb9b3\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a243ef42f644611789c19a3a018f4abd3f9fb9b3\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d96dc4a6986a08e13799d56d56961745aa115781\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d96dc4a6986a08e13799d56d56961745aa115781\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">꼭 은하단원이 아니라도</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"color: #0db4a0;\">단원의 내용이 간단한 경우 </span></b></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">활동하기 괜찮을 것 같습니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">좀 뻘쭘해할까 걱정했는데,</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\"><b>생각보다 아이들이 재미있어하고 좋아하네요.</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>&lt;교사 안내 사항&gt;</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><b>1. 은하단원 2쪽에 해당하는 문제만 7개 만드세요. (단답형이나 <b>OX퀴즈</b> OK)</b></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><b>2. 1문제는 통과! 프리패스 로 만듭니다.</b></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><b>3. 문제 내는 종이에 화살표는 글씨 방향을 안내하는 화살표입니다.</b></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><b>4. 문제 아래에 답을 쓰세요.</b></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>&lt;1:1 동서남북 게임하는 법&gt;</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><b>1. 매번 다른 사람과 만나 게임해야 합니다.</b></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><b>2. 1:1 로 만나 서로 1문제씩 풀고, 맞추면 K볼 지급합니다.</b></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><b>3. 번호 5개를 모두 모아야 상품이 있습니다.</b></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><b>4. 내가 필요한 번호의 K볼이 있다면, 내 문제 1개를 가르쳐 주면 원하는 번호를 받을 수 있습니다.</b></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><b>5. 내 이름 K볼을 모두 잃은 경우는, 획득한 K볼로 게임을 계속 진행해도 됩니다.</b></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/49b801bf5e0bda3441efb67cd587998ef3a0f1ae\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/49b801bf5e0bda3441efb67cd587998ef3a0f1ae\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>아이들이 만든 동서남북 종이를 회수해서&#160;</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>만든 문제를 보니, <span style=\"color: #ee2323;\">헉! 하는 오개념도</span> 발견할 수 있더구요. ^^;;</b></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d18366cc6cb79b3837dca5b38dad45c6c43903c2\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d18366cc6cb79b3837dca5b38dad45c6c43903c2\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f5462c9b22840a308d3231b376fbcdca693fe18d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f5462c9b22840a308d3231b376fbcdca693fe18d\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1327da4bca0fc45f4cea0fdeefa357a9ac326628\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1327da4bca0fc45f4cea0fdeefa357a9ac326628\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9bd930d6de410c3f97fb6ec22c0aeb376cf91a06\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9bd930d6de410c3f97fb6ec22c0aeb376cf91a06\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4277748ee40bdbf665b1ba3f9bebd8e9ec2eef26\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4277748ee40bdbf665b1ba3f9bebd8e9ec2eef26\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/792a294457042770f65f9c753f243edd181b5093\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/792a294457042770f65f9c753f243edd181b5093\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0a0b874f20b0527d5f027e34eb3582722b5aec4f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0a0b874f20b0527d5f027e34eb3582722b5aec4f\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">오...다음카페가 이제 이미지를 넣고 글을 써도 좀 안정적인 된 것 같습니다. ^-^</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
